Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 15:07:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] lane-144 GOAL 2 step 1: TQ3_4S (id 48) Vulkan port - dequant
 + mat-vec + mat-vec_id shaders, wired

Modelled on TQ3_1S: identical 32-value block, 3-bit packing, Lloyd-Max centroids, inverse RHT. Only the scale differs (four E3M5 bytes per group of 8 vs two f16 halves), and the four scale groups ARE the four 3-byte packing groups, so the group index each thread already computes serves both. E3M5 decode mirrors arifi_tq3_4s_decode_scale() incl. the byte==0 zero-scale case. 4 host pipeline rows + 4 dispatch-switch cases (to_fp16, mat-vec, mat-vec_id, supports_op). NOT in the ROTATED mul_mm_id switch and no get_rows: get_rows_quant.comp applies no inverse WHT. Build GREEN, 4 exes mtime 15:07:18, 4 new spv blobs.
